  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Change Programme - Pacific Voice</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity&#xA0;is focused on&#xA0;amplifying the Pacific voice, enabling the Pacific to tell its story, and influence global climate change negotiations with greater impact. The Activity enhances Pacific presence and visibility on the global stage in support of action on climate change; builds capacity of the Pacific to engage effectively in international negotiations, workshops and events; and build Pacific credibility by supporting them to deliver on their Paris Agreement reporting obligations.</narrative>
  </description>
